name tilings
category Package
revision 67292
shortdesc A TikZ library for drawing tiles and tilings
relocated 1
longdesc This package provides a TikZ library for working with tiles,
longdesc tilings, and tessellations. Using it, one can define tiles,
longdesc place tiles, deform tiles, and -- in some cases -- apply
longdesc replacement rules to generate tessellations. It has pre-defined
longdesc tiles for most of the Penrose tile sets and the aperiodical
longdesc polykite tiles. This is a replacement for the penrose package,
longdesc renamed as it now deals with more extensive tiles than just the
longdesc Penrose tile sets.
runfiles size=24
